"You were lucky to have stands. We had to lay out mats on the grass. There were no garages, either. Teams brought their own tents to work in."

pt:
//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/ma03/0110970a00'>
//「<RUBY text='スタンド'>観客席</RUBY>など無くて当然、芝生の上に<RUBY text='ござ'>茣蓙</RUBY>を
