"I still remember when Oji Suguru came to race at a track near my home. The race was small, and your father already close to his world debut. But still, the hero gave it his all."

pt:
//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/ma03/0111020a00'>
//「近在の競技場に皇路卓がやって来た時の事
